---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+19195550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(919) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Ductless Mini-Split | Wake Forest & Rolesville, NC" description="Ductless mini-split repair and installation in Wake Forest, NC.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Ductless Mini-Split</h1>
      <p>Ductless mini-split repair and installation in Wake Forest, NC.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
      <p>Mini-splits are ideal for additions, converted garages, older homes without ducts, and room-by-room zoning. We repair existing systems and install new ones.</p>
      <h2>What We Offer</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Repair of all major ductless brands</li>
        <li>Single and multi-zone installations</li>
        <li>Quiet, efficient cooling and heating</li>
        <li>Ideal for room additions and workshops</li>
        <li>Lower energy use than window units</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Ready for Fast Service?</h2>
      <p>Call or text <a href={`tel:${phone}`}>(919) 555-0199</a> for same-day AC service in Wake Forest, Rolesville, and nearby communities. Upfront pricing and a written estimate before any work begins.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call (919) 555-0199</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>